  "dct_description_sm": [
    "The primary purpose of the ROV survey at this site was to investigate the benthic fauna biodiversity at a site near Pond Inlet, in a deep-water, steep rock walls environment. A remotely operated vehicle (ROV) was used to video survey this site, and to selectively collect samples of corals and sponges for biodiversity and geochemical studies."
